    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## P04 harness\nPhase 1: 8 parallel requests to `/ratelimited` (5 per 10 s per client) -> expect 3 x 429.\nPhase 2: same 8 requests one at a time through the gate (`key=harness`, **2 per 10 s** - half the server quota because the server's window slides); every 3rd request is throttled, waits for the next window, asks again -> expect 0 x 429 and 3 throttles.",
        "height": 190,
